# ==============================================================================
# AI ENGLISH MASTER TEACHER - API KEYS CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# Note: The application is designed to run 100% out-of-the-box with the Built-in
# Smart Pedagogical Engine (zero configuration / completely free).
#
# If you wish to connect external LLM providers, you have TWO options:
#
# OPTION 1 (Easiest - Directly in the App UI):
# Click the "🔑 API Key" or Settings Gear icon in the top-right of the application
# at http://localhost:3000/, choose your provider (OpenRouter, Gemini, or OpenAI),
# paste your key, and click "Save Changes". It will be securely stored in your browser.
#
# OPTION 2 (Via Environment Variables):
# Copy this file to .env and insert your keys below:
# ==============================================================================

# 1. OpenRouter API Key (Supports multi-model beast-mode routing: Claude 3.5 Sonnet, GPT-4o, Gemini 2.5, DeepSeek-R1)
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here

# 2. Google Gemini API Key (Direct Gemini 2.0 Flash / 1.5 Flash)
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_google_gemini_api_key_here

# 3. OpenAI API Key (Direct GPT-4o / GPT-4o-mini)
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here
